curity policies within GitHub","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":1.6,"skills":["Cybersecurity"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Familiarize yourself with GitHub's basic security tools, which prepare repositories for secure development and industry-standard response to threats.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/manage-sensitive-data-security-policies/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-746447a74633dc79","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Introduction to Azure DocumentDB","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.5,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Explore the core features, architecture, and use cases for Azure DocumentDB, a fully managed MongoDB-compatible database service.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/introduction-azure-documentdb/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-6bcfafe42b6058fd","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Work smarter with Copilot prompts for IT professionals","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":0.32,"skills":["AI Tools"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"In this module, you'll learn how to use Microsoft 365 Copilot to work smarter and more efficiently as an IT professional. You'll explore how to use Copilot prompts to streamline your daily tasks, investigate incidents, troubleshoot systems, and coordinate with stakeholders effectively.","resourceUrl":"htt