les using SQL JOINs. Learn INNER, LEFT, RIGHT, FULL OUTER, and NATURAL joins with real examples.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/azure-databases/postgresql/basic-sql-join-tables/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-1147c708250d3ecb","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Configure platform-level security for Azure SQL","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.35,"skills":["SQL","Cloud Computing","Cybersecurity"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Configure authentication, network isolation, encryption, and access controls for Azure SQL Database and SQL Managed Instance. Implement Microsoft Entra ID\u2013only authentication with managed identity access for AI workloads, deploy private endpoints, and apply transparent data encryption, dynamic data masking, and row-level security to protect sensitive financial data.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/configure-azure-sql-platform-security/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-9b349c66c8547066","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Enhance a portrait using Relight in Microsoft Photos on a Copilot+ PC","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.38,"skills":["AI Tools"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"In this module, you learn how Relight can help you enhance portrait photos by adjusting lighting sources while maintaining a natural appearance.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/relight-microsoft-photos/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-a9e9fad71ef40bd4","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"When to evaluate Azure Local for private cloud scenarios","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.28,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"In this module, you\u2019ll explore why private cloud scenarios are reemerging, understand what Azure Local represents in private and hybrid cloud discussions, see how it works alongside existing Windows Server environments. You'll also learn how to recognize the signals and timing that indicate when Azure Local might be appropriate to introduce into infrastructure conversations.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/evaluate-azure-local/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-2de90bae3c2dcff9","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Connect non-Azure resources to Microsoft Defender for Cloud","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.73,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Connect non-Azure resources to Microsoft Defender for Cloud","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/connect-non-azure-machines-to-azure-defender/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-eb8626910edd1a4c","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Plan and implement security for private access to Azure resources","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.93,"skills":["Cloud Computing","Cybersecurity"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"This module focuses on equipping administrators with the knowledge and skills required to plan and implement robust security measures for private access to Azure resources, safeguarding sensitive data and enhancing network integrity.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/security-private-access-azure-resources/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-25a293cb43b5bcbd","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Deploy and Configure Microsoft Entra Global Secure Access","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.97,"skills":["Cybersecurity"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"The modern workforce transitioned from traditional office settings to working from nearly anywhere. This change in working location necessitates an identity-aware, cloud-delivered network perimeter. This identity-aware perimeter is known as Security Service Edge (SSE). The Microsoft SSE solution includes Microsoft Entra Internet Access and Microsoft Entra Private Access, collectively referred to as Global Secure Access. This solution is founded on Zero Trust principles, emphasizing least privilege, explicit verification, and an assumption of breach to ensure security in the cloud era.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/deploy-configure-microsoft-entra-global-secure-access/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-0f2c4a72ca0774a2","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Deploy containers to Azure Container Apps","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":1.2,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Create and manage container deployments in Azure Container Apps. Work with environments, runtime configuration, registry authentication, and deployment verification techniques.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/deploy-containers-azure-container-apps/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-0b44b75fd36da471","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Using GitHub Copilot with Python","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":0.37,"skills":["Python","AI Tools"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Make changes and updates to a Python application by using GitHub Copilot with Visual Studio Code.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/introduction-copilot-python/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-ce95290dab6c2087","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Generate documentation using GitHub Copilot tools","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":1.13,"skills":["AI Tools"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"This module explores the generation of code explanations, project documentation, and inline code comment documentation using the GitHub Copilot Chat extension for Visual Studio Code.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/generate-documentation-using-github-copilot-tools/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-73fbbd3f4b20021f","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Troubleshoot name resolution issues in Microsoft Azure","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.57,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":t