ity and management capabilities in Windows 11. Discover how these capabilities can be applied in real-world scenarios to support secure and manageable device environments.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/security-management/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-37713d9588e2c80a","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Describe the embedded experiences of Microsoft Security Copilot","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":0.87,"skills":["Cybersecurity","AI Tools"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Microsoft Security Copilot is accessible directly from some Microsoft security products. This is referred to the embedded experience. Learn about the scenarios supported by the Copilot embedded experience in Microsoft\u2019s security solutions.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/security-copilot-embedded-experiences/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-56b163f6c9a3eeb3","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Introduction to Azure Data Explorer","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":0.48,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Evaluate whether Azure Data Explorer is appropriate to process and analyze your big data.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/intro-to-azure-data-explorer/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-42b6c1a1da9dd912","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Introduction to Azure virtual machines","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":1.12,"skil