st your productivity with Microsoft Copilot","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":0.75,"skills":["AI Tools"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Learn how to enhance your productivity with Microsoft Copilot. This module covers various aspects of using Copilot to streamline your workflow, manage your time effectively, and support your job search and skill development. Discover how Copilot can assist you in bringing your ideas to life, analyzing images and documents, and providing workplace support.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/boost-productivity-with-copilot/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-03f8a307b820c3f3","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Operate with DevOps","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":0.9,"skills":["Git & DevOps"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Achieve operational excellence and enhance developer experience in your organization through DevOps. Your operational and development practices improve by implementing shift-right testing, observability through performance and security monitoring, Site Reliability Engineering and platform engineering.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/operate-with-devops/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-d3bef0c739a49e56","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Secure your identities by using Microsoft Entra ID","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Beginner","hours":0.45,"skills":["Cybersecurity"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor"