ible and customizable platforms, and high-quality text and image generation.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/intro-to-copilots-for-startups/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-8ae1b2dc78aa6b2e","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Build multi-item transactions with the Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":0.65,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Author stored procedures using JavaScript in Azure Cosmos DB for NoSQL.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/build-multi-item-transactions-azure-cosmos-db-sql-api/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-4c096622c5d4970c","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Build applications with Azure DocumentDB SDKs","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":1.0,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":true,"delivery":"online","setting":"indoor","hrdc":false,"instructor":"Microsoft Learn","hue":210,"description":"Build applications that connect to Azure DocumentDB using the official MongoDB drivers for Python, .NET, and JavaScript. Perform CRUD operations programmatically and integrate database operations into your application code.","resourceUrl":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/modules/build-applications-azure-documentdb-sdks/?WT.mc_id=api_CatalogApi","sourceType":"provider-catalogue"},{"id":"mslearn-231d3e058779f9f9","version":"2026-10-21T17:02:00+00:00","title":"Develop event-driven AI workflows with Azure Event Grid","provider":"Microsoft Learn","category":"Programming","level":"Intermediate","hours":1.4,"skills":["Cloud Computing"],"cost":0,"rating":0,"learners":0,"online":